  <trk>
    <name>Ness Glen</name>
    <desc>Walk from Dalmellington, along the top path of Ness Glen to Loch Doon, returning on the road, then down to River Doon via road to Craigengillan glamping pods and back along the same path to return to Dalmellington,</desc>
    <type>hikingTourTrail</type>
